
  <sn><md>### Rclone vs Other Sync Clients


| Feature                    | **Rclone**          | **Google Drive for Desktop**  | **Dropbox**     | **OneDrive**                         | **Insync**    |
| -------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------- |
| Linux                      | **Yes**             | ❌ Official client unavailable | ✅               | ⚠️ Third-party clients commonly used | ✅             |
| Windows                    | ✅                   | ✅                             | ✅               | ✅                                    | ✅             |
| macOS                      | ✅                   | ✅                             | ✅               | ✅                                    | ✅             |
| Google Drive               | **Excellent**       | **Excellent**                 | ❌               | ❌                                    | **Excellent** |
| Multiple cloud providers   | **70+**             | ❌                             | ❌               | ❌                                    | Limited       |
| Two-way sync               | ✅ `bisync`          | ✅                             | ✅               | ✅                                    | ✅             |
| One-way sync               | **Excellent**       | Limited                       | Limited         | Limited                              | ✅             |
| Cloud → cloud transfer     | **✅**               | ❌                             | ❌               | ❌                                    | Limited       |
| Mount cloud as folder/disk | **✅**               | ✅                             | Limited         | ✅                                    | ✅             |
| Command line               | **Excellent**       | ❌                             | Limited         | Limited                              | Limited       |
| Automation/scripts         | **Excellent**       | Limited                       | Limited         | Limited                              | ✅             |
| Encryption                 | **✅**               | ❌                             | ❌               | ❌                                    | ❌             |
| Backup                     | **Excellent**       | Limited                       | Limited         | Limited                              | Good          |
| GUI                        | ⚠️ Experimental/web | **Excellent**                 | **Excellent**   | **Excellent**                        | **Excellent** |
| Cost                       | **Free**            | Free                          | Free/paid plans | Free/paid plans                      | Paid          |

Rclone currently supports **70+ cloud storage products** and provides operations for copying, syncing, mounting, encrypting, checking and migrating data. ([Rclone][1])
